-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"ע/3: תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים תש"ע
-- The recuperation allowance (havraa) and the jubilee grant for school year
-- 2009/10: the 2010 reduction cancelled and moved to 2011 by the agreement of
-- 21.6.2010, who the reduction applies to, how the 2011 day price is reduced,
-- refunds, retirees, the days table and pro-rating, and the jubilee grant.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תש"ע/3 תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים תש"ע`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (22.6.2010), addressee and subject line; the operative sentence of its last paragraphs is encoded below.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2009/10 (common.l4: September 2009 =
-- 1, June 2010 = 10), except section 3ו(2)'s sixty days, counted in days.

@desc The populations of teaching staff section 1ד names.
DECLARE `havraa population` IS ONE OF
    `owners' secondary staff`
    @desc employed in the civil service in official education (kindergartens, primary schools, middle schools, special and adult education and so on)
    `state-employed staff in official education`
    @desc in recognized unofficial education, in kindergartens, primary schools (networks included) and middle schools
    `recognized unofficial kindergarten, primary and middle-school staff`
    `staff of teacher-training colleges`
    `staff of government secondary schools`

@desc A teaching employee's recuperation and jubilee year, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `havraa employee` HAS
    `population`                          IS A `havraa population`
    `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc represented by ארגון המורים העל-יסודיים
    `years of teaching seniority`         IS A NUMBER @desc counted with the year being served (the first year is 1)
    `position fraction`                   IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held that year (1 = one full position)
    `months worked`                       IS A NUMBER @desc months of work in the school year
    `paid havraa in 2009 before the June 2009 salary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `day price for the employee in 2011`  IS A NUMBER @desc the employee's own unreduced recuperation-day price in 2011, shekels
    `state day price in 2011`             IS A NUMBER @desc the unreduced recuperation-day price in the civil service in 2011, shekels; set elsewhere
    `state reduction per day in 2011`     IS A NUMBER @desc how much the civil-service day price is reduced by in 2011, shekels; set elsewhere
    `budgetary-pension retiree entitled to havraa from the former employer` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `havraa action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the recuperation allowance` HAS `havraa paid` IS A NUMBER
    `refund the 2010 reduction` HAS `refund paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the reduced part after retirement` HAS `part paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER

-- The preamble's operative sentence: after the agreement of 21/6/2010
-- between the Centre of Local Government and the teachers' organisation, on
-- deferring the reduction of recuperation pay from 2010 to 2011, approved on
-- 22/6/10, the allowance is paid in full this year (תש"ע); the instructions
-- follow.
@ref akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2010 allowance is paid in full for` h IF
    `the agreement covers` h

§§ `1 רקע כללי`

-- akn:art_1__para_a Background: the Partial Payment of Recuperation Pay in the Public Service Law (2009 and 2010, temporary provision) was published on 23.6.2009; no rule.
-- akn:art_1__para_b Background: section 3 of that law allows the reduction to run beyond 31.12.2010 as an approved agreement sets; no rule of this circular.

-- Section 1ג: by the collective agreement of 21/6/2010 (approved 22/6/10),
-- the teaching staff the secondary teachers' organisation represents have no
-- reduction in 2010 (the school year 1/9/09–31/8/10), any amount reduced for
-- 2010 is returned, and the reduction is made in 2011 instead.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`, `year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement reduces the allowance in` h `year` IF
    `the agreement covers` h AND `year` EQUALS 2011

GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement covers` h IF
    h's `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation`

-- Section 1ד: the instructions below on reducing recuperation pay do not
-- apply to the four populations it lists. Its second item is printed inside
-- the first item's row (the corpus carries "2)" mid-sentence).
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_4
GIVEN p IS A `havraa population`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded from the reduction instructions` p IF
    NOT (p EQUALS `owners' secondary staff`)

GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reduction instructions apply to` h IF
        `the agreement covers` h
    AND NOT `excluded from the reduction instructions` (h's `population`)

§§ `2 התקופה הקובעת`

-- "The agreement applies in 2010 and 2011, until 31 December 2011."
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies in` `year` IF
    `year` EQUALS 2010 OR `year` EQUALS 2011

`the last day the agreement applies` MEANS "31 December 2011"

§§ `3 ביטול הפחתת דמי הבראה בשנת 2010 וביצוע הפחתה בשנת 2011`

-- Section 3א: the allowance paid for 2010 (for teachers 1.9.2009–31.8.2010)
-- is not reduced; from 1.6.2010 the recuperation-day rate is 395 ₪.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a
`the reduction of the 2010 allowance` MEANS 0
`the recuperation-day price from 1.6.2010` MEANS 395

-- Section 3ב: the price of a recuperation day by which the allowance for
-- 2011 (for teachers 1.9.2010–31.8.2011) is computed is cut by half (50%),
-- and the allowance accordingly; the reduced 2011 amount will be published
-- in a separate circular.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the half cut of the 2011 day price` h IS
    h's `day price for the employee in 2011` TIMES `the 2011 reduction`

`the 2011 reduction` MEANS 0.5

-- Section 3ג: for a teacher of the owners of secondary schools the cut is no
-- more than the cut of the day price of a teacher in the civil service.
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cut in the day price in 2011` h IS
    min (`the half cut of the 2011 day price` h)
        (h's `state reduction per day in 2011`)

-- akn:art_3__para_c/p2 Clarifications on the 2011 reduction are to come in a separate circular; no rule here.

-- Section 3ד: an employee paid annually (retirees and the dead included)
-- whose 2010 allowance was already paid reduced before the June 2010 salary
-- is refunded the reduction with the July 2010 salary, and no later than the
-- August 2010 salary. The obligation's deadline is the later bound; July is
-- when it is due.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN `the reduction taken` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `refunding the 2010 reduction` `the reduction taken` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `refund the 2010 reduction` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the reduction taken`
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 3ד: the 2010 reduction is refunded with the July 2010 salary, no later than August's"

-- Section 3ה: an employee paid havraa, all or part, in 2009 before the June
-- 2009 salary is paid none in 2011; except that one entitled to more than
-- the civil service's day rate is paid in 2011 at a day price equal to the
-- difference between the two unreduced prices.
@ref akn:art_3__para_e
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the day price for an employee paid early in 2009` h IS
    max 0 (h's `day price for the employee in 2011` MINUS h's `state day price in 2011`)

-- Section 3ה's worked example: own price 500, civil service 400, so the
-- allowance is computed at 100 ₪ a day (printed "500 ₪ less 400 ₪").
@ref akn:art_3__para_e/p3
`the example employee of section 3ה` MEANS
    `havraa employee` WITH
        `population`                          IS `owners' secondary staff`
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`         IS 12
        `position fraction`                   IS 1
        `months worked`                       IS 10
        `paid havraa in 2009 before the June 2009 salary` IS TRUE
        `day price for the employee in 2011`  IS 500
        `state day price in 2011`             IS 400
        `state reduction per day in 2011`     IS 200
        `budgetary-pension retiree entitled to havraa from the former employer` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the day price in 2011` `the example employee of section 3ה` EQUALS 100

§§§ `3ו Retirement or death`

-- Section 3ו carries sections ו and ז of circular תשס"ט/9 (18.6.2009) over
-- to 2011 "instead of 2010" and quotes them: the allowance of a retiree or
-- one who died, paid annually and entitled also for the time after, is
-- reduced only for the part of the recuperation year before it. The
-- reduction it applies (sections ב–ו of that circular) is that circular's;
-- here it is an input.
@ref akn:art_3__para_f akn:art_3__para_f/p2
GIVEN `havraa for the part year before retirement` IS A NUMBER
      `reduction under circular תשס"ט/9`          IS A NUMBER @desc the reduction sections ב–ו of circular תשס"ט/9 make; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a retiree's havraa for the part year` `havraa for the part year before retirement` `reduction under circular תשס"ט/9` IS
    `havraa for the part year before retirement` MINUS `reduction under circular תשס"ט/9`

-- The quoted definition: "recuperation year" is a year — the bracket says
-- the school year 1/9/09–31/8/10, the year 2010 — for all or part of which
-- an allowance is paid whose payment date falls in the determining period;
-- while section 3ו applies the quote "for 2011 instead of 2010"
-- (F-2009-10_tasha_03-a).
@ref akn:art_3__para_f/p3
`the havraa year the quoted definition names` MEANS `havraa year span` "1/9/09" "31/8/10"

@desc A year of the circular's, by its first and last day as printed.
DECLARE `havraa year span` HAS
    `opens` IS A STRING
    `closes` IS A STRING

GIVEN s IS A `havraa year span`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the first school year of` s IS
    CONSIDER s's `opens`
    WHEN "1/9/09" THEN "2009/10"
    WHEN "1.9.2009" THEN "2009/10"
    WHEN "1.9.2010" THEN "2010/11"
    OTHERWISE "unknown"

@ref akn:art_3__para_b
`the year 2011 as section 3ב defines it` MEANS `havraa year span` "1.9.2010" "31.8.2011"

@ref akn:art_3__para_a
`the year 2010 as section 3א defines it` MEANS `havraa year span` "1.9.2009" "31.8.2010"

-- Section 3ו(2): retirement or death after the payment date: the employer
-- pays the entitled person the part reduced (if any) for the period after
-- it within 60 days. Time here in days from the retirement or death.
@ref akn:art_3__para_f__subpara_2
GIVEN `the part reduced for the period after` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `paying back the part after retirement` `the part reduced for the period after` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the reduced part after retirement` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the part reduced for the period after`
    WITHIN 60
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 3ו(2): the reduced part is paid within 60 days of the retirement or death"

§§§ `3ז`

-- Section 3ז: the reduction does not apply to a budgetary-pension retiree
-- entitled to havraa from the former employer.
@ref akn:art_3__para_g
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reduction does not reach a budgetary pensioner` h IF
    h's `budgetary-pension retiree entitled to havraa from the former employer`

-- Section 3ז's second sentence: for one entitled in 2010 and/or 2011 to the
-- allowance for a year partly active and partly in budgetary pension,
-- section 3ו governs.
@ref akn:art_3__para_g
GIVEN `active for part of the year` IS A BOOLEAN, `in budgetary pension for part of the year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 3ו governs a mixed year` `active for part of the year` `in budgetary pension for part of the year` IF
    `active for part of the year` AND `in budgetary pension for part of the year`

§§§ `The 2011 day price`

-- Sections 1ד, 3ב, 3ג, 3ה and 3ז together.
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 reduction applies to` h IF
        `the reduction instructions apply to` h
    AND NOT `the reduction does not reach a budgetary pensioner` h

@export The recuperation-day price a teaching employee of the owners is paid at in 2011 under circular תש"ע/3, sections 3ב, 3ג, 3ה and 3ז
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee` @desc the employee
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the day price in 2011` h IS
    IF `the 2011 reduction applies to` h
    THEN IF h's `paid havraa in 2009 before the June 2009 salary`
         THEN `the day price for an employee paid early in 2009` h
         ELSE h's `day price for the employee in 2011` MINUS `the cut in the day price in 2011` h
    ELSE h's `day price for the employee in 2011`

§§ `4 תשלום קצובת דמי הבראה`

-- Section 4א: the allowance is paid in full with the June 2010 salary.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `paying the allowance with June's salary` h IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the recuperation allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the 2010 recuperation allowance` h
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 4א: the allowance is paid in full with the June 2010 salary"

@export default The recuperation allowance a teaching employee of the owners is paid with the June 2010 salary under circular תש"ע/3
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee` @desc the employee's school year 2009/10
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2010 recuperation allowance` h IS
    `recuperation days for year` (h's `years of teaching seniority`)
    TIMES `the recuperation-day price from 1.6.2010`
    TIMES `the havraa share` h

-- Section 4ב's table as printed, days by teaching seniority; it has no
-- overlap and no hole from year 1.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the table of recuperation days` MEANS
    LIST `havraa days band` 1  3   7,
         `havraa days band` 4  10  9,
         `havraa days band` 11 15  10,
         `havraa days band` 16 19  11,
         `havraa days band` 20 24  12,
         `havraa days band` 25 999 13

DECLARE `havraa days band` HAS
    `from havraa year` IS A NUMBER
    `to havraa year`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `havraa band days` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation days for year` n IS
    sum (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `havraa band days`)
             (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from havraa year` AND n AT MOST b's `to havraa year`)
                     `the table of recuperation days`))

-- Section 4ג: pro-rated to the part-time position "(1/10 for each month of
-- work)"; 4ד: above a full position, one full position's allowance only.
-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-b: a year has twelve months, and the literal tenths
-- exceed the position. The reading adopted: the position share, counted
-- over at most ten months.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_d
GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa share` h IS
    min (h's `position fraction`) 1
    TIMES (min (h's `months worked`) 10 DIVIDED BY 10)

GIVEN h IS A `havraa employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share by literal tenths` h IS
    min (h's `position fraction`) 1
    TIMES (h's `months worked` DIVIDED BY 10)

§§ `5 תשלום מענק יובל`

@desc A teaching employee's record for the jubilee grant.
DECLARE `jubilee employee` HAS
    `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS A NUMBER @desc years, as set in the September before the grant, military service included, unpaid-leave years with pension rights bought included (clarification א)
    `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year`       IS A NUMBER @desc years completed on 1 June of the grant year, military service included
    `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS A NUMBER @desc years of work in Israel completed on 1 June, compulsory IDF service included
    `determining salary`                    IS A NUMBER @desc the salary determining pension and severance, without one-off yearly payments such as clothing and havraa; shekels
    `jubilee position fraction`             IS A NUMBER
    `share of the year employed`            IS A NUMBER @desc the fraction of the year the employee was employed

-- Section 5 ¶1: the jubilee grant is paid, to those entitled, with the June
-- 2010 salary.
@ref akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `havraa action`
DECIDE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` j IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the jubilee grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the jubilee grant` j
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 5: the jubilee grant is paid with the June 2010 salary"

-- Section 5 ¶2 and ¶4: 30 years and up of accumulated teaching seniority,
-- military service included, "according to the seniority set in September
-- of the year before the grant"; clarification א: an unpaid-leave year for
-- which pension rights were bought counts in those years (it is part of how
-- the seniority input is counted). Clarification ב differs
-- (F-2009-10_tasha_03-c, -d).
@ref akn:art_5/p2 akn:art_5/p4 akn:art_5__para_a
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant by section 5` j IF
    j's `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` AT LEAST 30

-- Section 5 ¶3 and clarification ג: 60% of the determining salary for
-- pension and severance, without one-off yearly payments such as clothing
-- and havraa, by the position that year up to one position, and by the
-- share of the period employed.
@ref akn:art_5/p3 akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant` j IS
    IF `entitled to the jubilee grant` j
    THEN j's `determining salary`
         TIMES 0.6
         TIMES min (j's `jubilee position fraction`) 1
         TIMES j's `share of the year employed`
    ELSE 0

-- akn:art_5/p5 The heading "הבהרות" over clarifications א–ג; no rule.

-- Clarification ב: one who completed 30 years of work in Israel,
-- compulsory IDF service included, on 1 June of the year is entitled to the
-- grant that year.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification ב` j IF
    j's `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year` AT LEAST 30

-- The reading adopted (F-2009-10_tasha_03-c): clarification ב, the later
-- and more specific clause, decides the date, 1 June of the grant year.
-- (F-2009-10_tasha_03-d): what is counted is section 5's own measure,
-- accumulated teaching seniority with military service, completed by that
-- date — as in every jubilee circular.
-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-e: "30 שנה ומעלה" or once, in the year the 30 are
-- completed (clarification ב's "באותה שנה"). The reading adopted: once —
-- seniority on 1 June within a year of 30 — as F-2006-07_tashsaz_06-d,
-- F-2007-08_tashsach_05-c and F-2008-09_tashsat_09-e read the same words.
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the jubilee grant` j IF
        j's `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year` AT LEAST 30
    AND j's `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year` LESS THAN 31

-- Section 5 ¶2's own words, "30 שנה ומעלה", measured on 1 June, with no
-- year named.
@ref akn:art_5/p2
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the "30 years and more" section 5 names` j IF
    j's `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year` AT LEAST 30

-- akn:art_6 The contact line for questions; no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from havraa year` AND n AT MOST b's `to havraa year`) `the table of recuperation days`) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 3, 4, 10, 11, 15, 16, 19, 20, 24, 25, 40)

-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-a: the quoted year is 2009/10.
`the quoted havraa year is 2010 while section 3ו applies it to 2011` MEANS
        `the first school year of` `the havraa year the quoted definition names`
        EQUALS `the first school year of` `the year 2010 as section 3א defines it`
    AND NOT (`the first school year of` `the havraa year the quoted definition names`
             EQUALS `the first school year of` `the year 2011 as section 3ב defines it`)
#ASSERT `the quoted havraa year is 2010 while section 3ו applies it to 2011`

-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-b: the literal tenths give more than the position.
`a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` MEANS
    `havraa employee` WITH
        `population`                          IS `owners' secondary staff`
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`         IS 22
        `position fraction`                   IS 0.5
        `months worked`                       IS 12
        `paid havraa in 2009 before the June 2009 salary` IS FALSE
        `day price for the employee in 2011`  IS 395
        `state day price in 2011`             IS 395
        `state reduction per day in 2011`     IS 197.5
        `budgetary-pension retiree entitled to havraa from the former employer` IS FALSE

`the literal tenths give more than the position` MEANS
    `the share by literal tenths` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months`
    GREATER THAN `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months`'s `position fraction`
#ASSERT `the literal tenths give more than the position`

#ASSERT `the 2010 recuperation allowance` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` EQUALS 2370

-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-c, -d: section 5 and clarification ב.
`a teacher reaching 30 years between September and June` MEANS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS 29
        `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year`       IS 30
        `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS 30
        `determining salary`                    IS 10000
        `jubilee position fraction`             IS 1
        `share of the year employed`            IS 1

`section 5 and clarification ב date the seniority differently` MEANS
    NOT (`entitled to the jubilee grant by section 5` `a teacher reaching 30 years between September and June`
         EQUALS `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification ב` `a teacher reaching 30 years between September and June`)
#ASSERT `section 5 and clarification ב date the seniority differently`

`a teacher with ten years of other work in Israel` MEANS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS 20
        `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year`       IS 20
        `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS 30
        `determining salary`                    IS 10000
        `jubilee position fraction`             IS 1
        `share of the year employed`            IS 1

`section 5 and clarification ב count different years` MEANS
        `entitled to the jubilee grant by clarification ב` `a teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`
    AND NOT `entitled to the jubilee grant by section 5` `a teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`
#ASSERT `section 5 and clarification ב count different years`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the jubilee grant` `a teacher with ten years of other work in Israel`

#ASSERT `the jubilee grant` `a teacher reaching 30 years between September and June` EQUALS 6000

#TRACE `paying the allowance with June's salary` `a half-position teacher employed all twelve months` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the recuperation allowance` 2370 AT 10
#TRACE `refunding the 2010 reduction` 1000 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `refund the 2010 reduction` 1000 AT 11
#TRACE `paying back the part after retirement` 500 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the reduced part after retirement` 500 AT 75
#TRACE `paying the jubilee grant with June's salary` `a teacher reaching 30 years between September and June` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the jubilee grant` 6000 AT 10

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over its whole finite space: seniority years 1 to 60,
-- positions in quarters from 0 to 1.5, 0 to 12 months; every population,
-- represented or not, paid early or not, pensioner or not, with own day
-- prices of 300 to 600, civil-service prices of 300 to 500 and its cut of
-- 150 to 250 in steps of 50; and a career's seniority on 1 June from 0 to
-- 45 in quarter years.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`positions in quarters` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 4) (range 0 6)
`every population` MEANS
    LIST `owners' secondary staff`, `state-employed staff in official education`,
         `recognized unofficial kindergarten, primary and middle-school staff`,
         `staff of teacher-training colleges`, `staff of government secondary schools`

GIVEN w IS A `havraa population`, r IS A BOOLEAN, n IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, e IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER, c IS A NUMBER, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `havraa employee`
DECIDE `a checked employee` w r n f m e o s c b IS
    `havraa employee` WITH
        `population`                          IS w
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS r
        `years of teaching seniority`         IS n
        `position fraction`                   IS f
        `months worked`                       IS m
        `paid havraa in 2009 before the June 2009 salary` IS e
        `day price for the employee in 2011`  IS o
        `state day price in 2011`             IS s
        `state reduction per day in 2011`     IS c
        `budgetary-pension retiree entitled to havraa from the former employer` IS b

-- 4ב: every year of seniority from 1 to 60 is in exactly one band, and
-- the days never fall. 4ג-ד over every band's edges, position and month
-- count: the 2010 allowance is never negative, never above 13 days at
-- 395, never falls with a larger position or a month more, and is the
-- band's full allowance exactly for a full position and ten months.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from havraa year` AND n AT MOST b's `to havraa year`) `the table of recuperation days`) EQUALS 1
                AND `recuperation days for year` n AT MOST `recuperation days for year` (n PLUS 1))
            (range 1 60)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                        all (GIVEN m YIELD
                                LET a MEANS `the 2010 recuperation allowance` (`a checked employee` `owners' secondary staff` TRUE n f m FALSE 395 395 197.5 FALSE)
                                    full MEANS `recuperation days for year` n TIMES 395
                                IN      a AT LEAST 0
                                    AND a AT MOST 13 TIMES 395
                                    AND a AT MOST `the 2010 recuperation allowance` (`a checked employee` `owners' secondary staff` TRUE n (f PLUS 0.25) m FALSE 395 395 197.5 FALSE)
                                    AND a AT MOST `the 2010 recuperation allowance` (`a checked employee` `owners' secondary staff` TRUE n f (m PLUS 1) FALSE 395 395 197.5 FALSE)
                                    AND (a EQUALS full) EQUALS (f AT LEAST 1 AND m AT LEAST 10))
                            (range 0 12))
                    `positions in quarters`)
            (LIST 1, 3, 4, 10, 11, 15, 16, 19, 20, 24, 25, 60)

-- 1ד, 3ב-3ה, 3ז over every population, representation, early payment,
-- pensioner and price: the 2011 day price is never negative and never
-- above the employee's own; it is the own price exactly where the
-- reduction does not apply; reduced, a teacher not paid early loses half
-- the price or the civil service's cut, whichever is less; one paid early
-- is paid at the difference over the civil service's price.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN w YIELD
                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                        all (GIVEN e YIELD
                                all (GIVEN b YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN o YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                                                LET h MEANS `a checked employee` w r 12 1 10 e (o TIMES 50) (s TIMES 50) (c TIMES 50) b
                                                                    d MEANS `the day price in 2011` h
                                                                IN      d AT LEAST 0
                                                                    AND d AT MOST o TIMES 50
                                                                    AND `the 2011 reduction applies to` h EQUALS (r AND w EQUALS `owners' secondary staff` AND (NOT b))
                                                                    AND ((`the 2011 reduction applies to` h) OR d EQUALS o TIMES 50)
                                                                    AND ((NOT `the 2011 reduction applies to` h) OR e
                                                                         OR d EQUALS o TIMES 50 MINUS min (o TIMES 25) (c TIMES 50))
                                                                    AND ((NOT `the 2011 reduction applies to` h) OR (NOT e)
                                                                         OR d EQUALS max 0 (o TIMES 50 MINUS s TIMES 50)))
                                                            (range 3 5))
                                                    (range 6 10))
                                            (range 6 12))
                                    `both booleans`)
                            `both booleans`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `every population`

-- Section 5 on the readings adopted, over a career's seniority on 1 June
-- from 0 to 45 in quarter years: the grant falls in the year the 30 are
-- completed and no other, never above 60% of the determining salary.
GIVEN t IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `jubilee employee`
DECIDE `a checked jubilee employee` t f s IS
    `jubilee employee` WITH
        `teaching seniority set in September before the grant` IS t MINUS 0.75
        `teaching seniority on 1 June of the grant year`       IS t
        `years of work in Israel on 1 June of the grant year`  IS t
        `determining salary`                    IS 10000
        `jubilee position fraction`             IS f
        `share of the year employed`            IS s

#ASSERT all (GIVEN q YIELD
                `entitled to the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` (q DIVIDED BY 4) 1 1)
                EQUALS (q AT LEAST 120 AND q LESS THAN 124))
            (range 0 180)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                all (GIVEN s YIELD
                        LET g MEANS `the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` 30 f s)
                        IN      g AT LEAST 0
                            AND g AT MOST 6000
                            AND g AT MOST `the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` 30 (f PLUS 0.25) s)
                            AND g AT MOST `the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` 30 f (s PLUS 0.25)))
                    (LIST 0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1))
            `positions in quarters`

-- F-2009-10_tasha_03-e: over the same career, section 5's "30 שנה ומעלה"
-- and the once-only reading part in exactly the years from the 31st on; a
-- teacher in year 35 is in the one and not the other.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN q YIELD
                (NOT (`has the "30 years and more" section 5 names` (`a checked jubilee employee` (q DIVIDED BY 4) 1 1)
                      EQUALS `entitled to the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` (q DIVIDED BY 4) 1 1)))
                EQUALS (q AT LEAST 124))
            (range 0 180)

`"30 years and more" reaches a 35-year teacher, the once-only reading does not` MEANS
        `has the "30 years and more" section 5 names` (`a checked jubilee employee` 35 1 1)
    AND NOT `entitled to the jubilee grant` (`a checked jubilee employee` 35 1 1)
#ASSERT `"30 years and more" reaches a 35-year teacher, the once-only reading does not`
